    "updated_at": "2017-10-02T16:03:13Z",
    "body": "@annevk \r\n\r\n1. `MessageChannel` is not exposed in `AudioWorkletGlobalScope`. The UA will create a channel object internally, and expose its ports to the global scope. Since the port object does not offer the reference to its channel, so there is no way to access the channel object. Correct me if I am wrong. ([spec](https://webaudio.github.io/web-audio-api/#instantiation-of-AudioWorkletNode-and-AudioWorkletProcessor))\r\n\r\n2. I'll expose `MessageEvent` in AudioWorklet.\r\n\r\n3. Can you point me to the reference on how these should be tested? Should tests be a part of this PR?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
