    "updated_at": "2017-10-02T17:25:32Z",
    "body": "@hoch I think they should be tested as part of audio worklets somehow, so probably as part of that specification effort. I would expect IDL harness tests to make sure the interfaces are properly exposed, and also basic functionality tests (ideally more advanced ones too).\r\n\r\nI guess it's fair that folks can't create their own `MessageChannel` in an audio worklet. That logic probably shouldn't live there.",
