    "body": "@annevk So the testing should be a collective effort from the working group, not the browser vendor? Chrome's implementation will have a set of tests including IDL harness test and etc, but I am not sure how to frame this for our working group. Perhaps filing an issue on the tracker is good enough for now?\r\n\r\nAlso is there anything else to do in this PR?",
